[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3842.309, "timestamp": "01:04:02", "text": "我们能创造出好东西吗？ 是啊，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3844.87, "timestamp": "01:04:04", "text": "我也是这么想的。 这简直"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3848.789, "timestamp": "01:04:08", "text": "就是痛苦和折磨。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3852.95, "timestamp": "01:04:12", "text": "其实不是，不过可以。  Shock先生，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3859.91, "timestamp": "01:04:19", "text": "杰克，你还记得有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3860.99, "timestamp": "01:04:20", "text": "一次那"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3864.15, "timestamp": "01:04:24", "text": "个人来到我们的服务器，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3867.43, "timestamp": "01:04:27", "text": "开始送我们东西吗？ 哦，是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3868.95, "timestamp": "01:04:28", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3870.27, "timestamp": "01:04:30", "text": "他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3873.27, "timestamp": "01:04:33", "text": "只是……嗯。 自从他那样做之后，我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3877.589, "timestamp": "01:04:37", "text": "游戏进程就变得容易多了。   是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3879.91, "timestamp": "01:04:39", "text": "。 我太感谢他了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3882.829, "timestamp": "01:04:42", "text": "黑客。   是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3884.39, "timestamp": "01:04:44", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3885.99, "timestamp": "01:04:45", "text": "弹药。"}]